answers.workaround:
This can be worked around by using this shader:
```glsl
shader_type canvas_item;

uniform sampler2D screen : hint_screen_texture;

void fragment() {
	COLOR = COLOR - texture(screen,SCREEN_UV);
	COLOR.a = 1.;
}
```
which is sadly way more performance heavy, and can not invert the background multiple times since it uses the screen texture which is only generated once per viewport.
